    "pr_title": "Update MICS API to use instance pointer instead of bt_conn ",
    "pr_body": "Updates the MICS API to use the bt_mics instance pointer instead of a bt_conn pointer. This was requsted during a recent API discussion, and should make the API simpler, especially since it's the same API for local and remote procedures.\r\n\r\nFixes: #36306 \r\nFixed #36307 \r\n",
    "pr_comments": [
        "Depends on https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/pull/36060"
    ],
    "merged": true,
    "created_at": "2021-06-23T09:29:20Z",
