        "number": 36307,
        "title": "[Coverity CID: 236605] Logically dead code in subsys/bluetooth/audio/mics.c",
        "body": "\nStatic code scan issues found in file:\n\nhttps://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/tree/d25e5c20a07203443b2e9fafe30bf8eef852ed23/subsys/bluetooth/audio/mics.c#L267\n\nCategory: Control flow issues\nFunction: `bt_mics_unmute`\nComponent: Bluetooth\nCID: [236605](https://scan9.coverity.com/reports.htm#v29726/p12996/mergedDefectId=236605)\n\n\nDetails:\n\nhttps://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/d25e5c20a07203443b2e9fafe30bf8eef852ed23/subsys/bluetooth/audio/mics.c#L267\n\n```\n261             uint8_t val = BT_MICS_MUTE_UNMUTED;\n262             int err = write_mute(NULL, NULL, &val, sizeof(val), 0, 0);\n263    \n264             return err > 0 ? 0 : err;\n265         }\n266     #endif /* CONFIG_BT_MICS */\n>>>     CID 236605:  Control flow issues  (DEADCODE)\n>>>     Execution cannot reach this statement: \"return -95;\".\n267         return -EOPNOTSUPP;\n268     }\n269    \n270     int bt_mics_mute(struct bt_conn *conn)\n271     {\n272         if (conn != NULL) {\n```\n\nFor more information about the violation, check the [Coverity Reference](https://scan9.coverity.com/doc/en/cov_checker_ref.html#static_checker_DEADCODE). [CWE-561](http://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/561.html)\n\nPlease fix or provide comments in coverity using the link:\n\nhttps://scan9.coverity.com/reports.htm#v29271/p12996\n\nNote: This issue was created automatically. Priority was set based on classification\nof the file affected and the impact field in coverity. Assignees were set using the CODEOWNERS file.\n",
